+ *   16 bit SPMI address = peripheral id (bits 15:8) | register (bits 7:0)
+ *   arbiter PPID (12 bit) = (SPMI SID << 8) | peripheral id
+ *   a PMIC GPIO block gives every pin its own 0x100 byte page:
+ *   pm8350 gpio base peripheral 0x88 (DT reg 0x8800), pin N -> 0x88 + N
+ *   -> volume-up (pin 6) = peripheral 0x8e of SID 1 = PPID 0x18e
